step	1	-	Getting into the lighthouse
line	<col=000080>Larrissa is very worried about her boyfriend Jossik.</col>
line	<col=000080>I need to <col=800000>repair the bridge</col> leading to Rellekka.</col>
line	<col=000080>I also need to get the <col=800000>lighthouse key</col> from her cousin <col=800000>Gunnjorn</col>.</col>
step	2	-	In the lighthouse
step	3	-	After the quest
line	<str>I repaired the bridge leading to Rellekka and got a key from Gunnjorn so I could enter the lighthouse.</str>
line	<str>I managed to repair the lighthouse light with some molten glass, some swamp tar and a tinderbox.</str>
line	<str>I found Jossik in an underground cavern, behind a strange wall where he had been attacked by some sea creatures.</str>
line	<str>After I entered the lighthouse, and repaired the lighting mechanism, I discovered a strange wall that blocked the entrance to an underground cavern, where Jossik was.</str>
line	<str>After I killed some strange sea monsters, I managed to get Jossik out of the cavern and back to the lighthouse.</str>
line	<str>I found a strange casket on the dead body of a sea monster, which Jossik said he could tell me about.</str>
line	
line	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
